	)
	(text "TWEETER BRANCH - Dayton RST28F-4 (4 ohm)"
		(at 38.1 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bf9f7497-1b60-48f4-b7d9-f4359b082272")
	)
	(text "WOOFER BRANCH - Dayton RS180P-8 (8 ohm)"
		(at 38.1 92.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "09740223-8625-4a0b-a1d0-8286949ad8be")
	)
	(text "IN from Fosi V3 amplifier"
		(at 12.7 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "04ba6170-41f0-4d88-be0b-7ab8df73e54b")
	)
	(text "(TPA3255, 48 V rail)"
		(at 12.7 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cc03319c-3238-4f7a-ad70-1052d9a52be9")
	)
	(text "series tank in the branch, not a shunt"
		(at 45.72 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0bc84921-d382-4be9-a1e5-d26cafc5b894")
	)
	(text "series tank in the branch, not a shunt"
		(at 121.92 133.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "56e8b6d5-6c10-491b-9f78-422a1e6ad0c3")
	)
	(text "NOTES  -  one board per speaker, build two.   Value field = DTU component shop part number."
		(at 12.7 146.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d1a2ca52-97fb-4a6a-b6ac-af0560b549ef")
	)
	(text "1. GND = IN- , the amplifier's negative speaker terminal and the common return for both drivers."
		(at 12.7 149.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f06f862a-fe0c-4aba-822c-24efc9f0106d")
	)
	(text "   It is NOT chassis earth, and the two boards' returns must not be tied to each other."
		(at 12.7 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b2b1dab9-c68b-4ab5-adc5-2b9d6b4049d6")
	)
	(text "2. All capacitors are FILM and must be rated >= 63 V, 100 V preferred. The shop lists no voltage"
		(at 12.7 158.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "acdca173-a97e-4383-a300-0abb92e8c448")
	)
	(text "   rating, so CHECK THE PRINTING ON THE ACTUAL PARTS before fitting them."
		(at 12.7 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d01752bb-9bd4-4a3d-9354-10ee37de699c")
	)
	(text "3. Series pairs:   R101+R102 = 9.4 ohm / 10 W (design 10 ohm).   R201+R202 = 20 ohm / 10 W (20)."
		(at 12.7 166.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "86d7214c-054a-49a1-93f2-c3b237801068")
	)
	(text "4. Parallel caps:  C102||C103 = 5.5uF (5.6).  C104||C105 = 10.1uF (10).  C201..C205 = 41uF (40)."
		(at 12.7 171.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0aa1ca56-8110-4bed-8431-96b29153e67d")
	)
	(text "                   C206||C207 = 11.5uF (12).  Each part's 'Design value' field holds the original."
		(at 12.7 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8585aed3-fef3-4ebd-923a-44396f55a8d4")
	)
	(text "5. L101/L102/L201/L202 are air-core coils, 0.8 mm (20 AWG) wire - self-wound or bought (Dayton"
		(at 12.7 179.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f0e009c9-e371-4458-bd8e-be87636d4e31")
	)
	(text "   AC20-20 / AC20-25 / AC20-70 / AC202 or Jantzen Audio equivalents. Target DCR is in Description."
		(at 12.7 184.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "150d598d-265a-4125-b5e4-d1049605df6d")
	)
	(text "6. FOOTPRINTS ARE PROVISIONAL: measure cap lead pitch before routing. Coils mount OFF the board (lead pads only)."
		(at 12.7 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e8be2b00-10d1-4ec5-a642-a690a7e65e73")
	)
	(text "7. Single-sided board, CNC isolation-milled with a 0.8 mm end mill. Through-hole only."
		(at 12.7 191.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d7b0236f-23da-41d9-a146-053d2267d954")
	)
